        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents D04-K322D, Fleur De Lis 3 x 18 Dummy Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis gorgeous entrance set features the popular Fleur de Lis design at both ends, as well as patterned edges with incredible detail. The  Fleur De Lis Set is a dummy handleset--both plates are surface mounted and are used to match the trim on a inactive side of a pair of double doors. The 3 Inch x 18 inch Fleur De Lis Dummy Set is avilabelin a wide array of finish color options with your choice of knob or lever.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Double Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of the door. It do not latch and do not lock.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/fleur-de-lis-entry-set-brass-accents-d04-k322\"><b>Fleur De Lis Entry Set</b></a> for the active side of your double doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Dummy Fleur De Lis Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Cast Brass</li>\r\n<li>Interior and Exterior Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior and Exterior Plate Height: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Surface Mounted</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
